<title>KENYA: CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT SRI LANKA BY 82 RUNS.</title>
<headline>CRICKET-PAKISTAN BEAT SRI LANKA BY 82 RUNS.</headline>
<dateline>NAIROBI 1996-10-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>Pakistan beat Sri Lanka by 82 runs in their one-day (50 overs) four nations cricket tournament match on Friday.</p>
<p>Scores: Pakistan 371-9 innings closed; Sri Lanka 289 in 49.5 overs.</p>
</text>
